      "help": "Select the timekeeping units of the game. This cannot be changed later.Calendar-based is the classic OpenTTD experience, with a year consisting of 12 months, and each month having 28-31 days.In Wallclock-based time, cargo production and financials are instead based on one-minute increments, which is about as long as a 30 day month takes in Calendar-based mode. These are grouped into 12-minute periods, equivalent to a year in Calendar-based mode.In either mode there is always a classic calendar, which is used for introduction dates of vehicles, houses, and other infrastructure",
